= (c0 In×n + c1 A + · · · + cn An)~x
= cn(A − z1 In×n) · · · (A − zn In×n)~x by our factorization
Thus, at least one A − zi In×n has a null space, showing that there exists ~v with A~v = zi~v, as needed.
